<title>MALAYSIA: Bank Negara borrows for 1-mth deposit at 7.05 pct.</title>
<headline>Bank Negara borrows for 1-mth deposit at 7.05 pct.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1996-10-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bank Negara Malaysia said it borrowed for a one-month deposit at 7.05 percent, unchanged from its previous intervention level.</p>
<p>The central bank's last open market intervention was on Oct 4.</p>
</text>
